<main class="flex-1"><!--$--><section class="relative hero-bg stone-grain pt-16 pb-20 md:pt-24 md:pb-28 border-b border-border overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 grid-glow opacity-60"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-6 text-center"><div class="inline-block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-gold mb-4">Factory &amp; Production</div><h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] max-w-4xl mx-auto">From Egyptian Quarry to Your Container</h1><p class="mt-5 text-base md:text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">A continuous, inspected production process — every block traced from selection through polishing, packing, and shipment.</p></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 "><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="<?php echo esc_url(home_url('/')); ?>" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" /></svg></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-foreground">Factory</span></li></ol></nav><div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><p class="text-foreground">Every Egyptian granite shipment from Egyptian Granite by EG begins at the quarry face and ends sealed inside a container at the port. In between sits a continuous, inspected production process — block selection, gangsaw and block-cutter sawing, optional resin treatment, finishing, dimensional and surface QC, traceable numbering, ISPM-15 wooden packing, container loading, and full export documentation.</p><p>Our material is quarried across Egypt&#x27;s historic granite belts: the <strong>Aswan</strong> belt in Upper Egypt for Black Aswan, Red Aswan, and the Gandola family; the <strong>Halayeb</strong> region on the Red Sea coast for New Halayeb and the Halayeb whites; the <strong>Sharka (Shirka)</strong> belt for Grey Shirka and Sherka; <strong>Forsan</strong> and the broader <strong>Eastern Desert</strong> for Red Forsan, Red Horus, Red Nefertiti, and Rosa El Nasr / Rosa Hody; and <strong>South Sinai</strong> around Saint Katherine for Rosa Katrina.</p><p>Quarry blocks are hand-selected for color, grain, and structural integrity, then trucked to our processing factory. Gangsaw lines produce large-format slabs (typically 2.6–3.0 m × 1.6–2.0 m) in 2 and 3 cm thickness; block cutters produce calibrated tiles (30×30 up to 80×80 cm in 1, 1.5, or 2 cm). Cut-to-size production runs in parallel: stairs, treads, risers, countertops, vanities, façade panels, and copings made to your project drawings.</p><p>After cutting, finishing lines deliver the full range of surface finishes — polished, honed, flamed, brushed, sandblasted, bush-hammered, tumbled, split-face, leathered, and acid-washed. Every piece is then inspected for color, finish, dimensional tolerance, and structural quality before bundling. Slabs go to A-frame wooden bundles with foam interleaves and corner protection; tiles into ISPM-15 fumigated wooden crates; blocks load loose with hardwood dunnage.</p></div><div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><figure class="group relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-card aspect-[4/3]"><img src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri()); ?>/assets/img/factory-quarry-DKFvCUd2.jpg" alt="Egyptian granite quarry in Aswan with stacked blocks of red and black granite" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="768" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"/><figcaption class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-4 text-sm bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent text-white">Egyptian Quarry — Aswan blocks</figcaption></figure><figure class="group relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-card aspect-[4/3]"><img src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri()); ?>/assets/img/factory-cutting-CCbpoKOy.jpg" alt="Industrial gangsaw cutting an Egyptian granite block into slabs in a modern stone factory" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="768" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"/><figcaption class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-4 text-sm bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent text-white">Factory Cutting Line</figcaption></figure><figure class="group relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border bg-card aspect-[4/3]"><img src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri()); ?>/assets/img/factory-packing-BH_vqAay.jpg" alt="Polished Egyptian granite slabs packed in wooden A-frame export bundles ready for container loading" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="768" class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"/><figcaption class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-4 text-sm bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent text-white">Export Packing &amp; Loading</figcaption></figure></div><div class="mt-10 space-y-4"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->01</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mountain h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Block Selection</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Hand-selected granite blocks from Egyptian quarries — checked for color, grain, and structural integrity.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->02</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scissors h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3" /><path d="M8.12 8.12 12 12" /><path d="M20 4 8.12 15.88" /><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3" /><path d="M14.8 14.8 20 20" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Cutting</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Gangsaw and block cutter processing for slabs, tiles, and cut-to-size pieces with precise tolerances.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->03</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z" /><path d="M20 2v4" /><path d="M22 4h-4" /><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Resin / Treatment</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Optional resin treatment to enhance color and fill micro-fissures when required by specification.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->04</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z" /><path d="M20 2v4" /><path d="M22 4h-4" /><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Polishing / Finishing</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Full range of surface finishes — polished, honed, flamed, brushed, sandblasted, bush-hammered.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->05</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" /><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Quality Inspection</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Every piece inspected for color, finish, dimensions, and structural quality.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->06</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-tag h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z" /><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Numbering &amp; Labeling</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Each slab and bundle numbered, labeled, and traceable to your order.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->07</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z" /><path d="M12 22V12" /><polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7" /><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Wooden Packing</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">A-frame bundles and ISPM-15 compliant wooden crates with foam and corner protection.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->08</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-truck h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2" /><path d="M15 18H9" /><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14" /><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2" /><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Container Loading</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Professional loading optimized for material volume and shipping stability.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->09</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z" /><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5" /><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Export Documentation</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Commercial invoice, packing list, certificate of origin, bill of lading, and inspection certificates.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[80px_60px_1fr] gap-4 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border hover:border-gold/40 transition"><div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Step <!-- -->10</div><div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ship h-5 w-5 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 10.189V14" /><path d="M12 2v3" /><path d="M19 13V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6" /><path d="M19.38 20A11.6 11.6 0 0 0 21 14l-8.188-3.639a2 2 0 0 0-1.624 0L3 14a11.6 11.6 0 0 0 2.81 7.76" /><path d="M2 21c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1s1.2 1 2.5 1c2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1" /></svg></div><div><div class="font-display text-xl">Worldwide Shipping</div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Container shipment from Egyptian ports to your destination — FOB or CIF.</p></div></div></div></section><!--/$--></main>
